  description: '"Queen Azamina" + 1 Fusion or Synchro Monster

    Must first be
    either Fusion Summoned, or Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by Tributing
    1 "Saint Azamina" you control and 1 face-up monster your opponent controls. Cannot
    be destroyed by card effects. Each time your opponent activates a card or effect,
    all monsters they control lose 500 ATK when it resolves. Your opponent cannot
    activate the effects of monsters with 0 ATK.'
